---
// 统计硬核图：左=误差棒随题量按 1/√n 缩短；右=独立两组 vs 同题配对检出 2pp 所需题量
---

<figure>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 272" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <g font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">
      <text x="320" y="24" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#0c5f74" text-anchor="middle">差几分才算「赢」：题量与怎么比，决定分差有没有意义</text>

      <text x="160" y="56" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">单模型正确率的 95% 置信区间</text>
      <line x1="60" y1="210" x2="270" y2="210" stroke="#94a3b8"/>
      <line x1="60" y1="80" x2="60" y2="210" stroke="#94a3b8"/>
      {[
        {x:100, half:58, label:"100 题"},
        {x:170, half:24, label:"1,000 题"},
        {x:240, half:8, label:"10,000 题"},
      ].map((b)=> (
        <g>
          <circle cx={b.x} cy="130" r="4" fill="#0085a1"/>
          <line x1={b.x} y1={130-b.half} x2={b.x} y2={130+b.half} stroke="#0085a1" stroke-width="2.5"/>
          <line x1={b.x-8} y1={130-b.half} x2={b.x+8} y2={130-b.half} stroke="#0085a1" stroke-width="2.5"/>
          <line x1={b.x-8} y1={130+b.half} x2={b.x+8} y2={130+b.half} stroke="#0085a1" stroke-width="2.5"/>
          <text x={b.x} y="226" font-size="8.5" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">{b.label}</text>
        </g>
      ))}
      <text x="160" y="80" font-size="9" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">误差约按 1/√n 缩小：±10pp → ±3pp → ±1pp</text>
      <text x="40" y="134" font-size="8.5" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="end">正确率</text>

      <text x="470" y="56" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">要检出 2 个百分点，需要多少题</text>
      <rect x="350" y="80" width="240" height="58" rx="8" fill="#fdf0e0" stroke="#e6a23c"/>
      <text x="470" y="104" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#b97a1f" text-anchor="middle">不同题集、独立两组</text>
      <text x="470" y="125" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#b97a1f" text-anchor="middle">每组约 9,800 题（≈1 万）</text>
      <rect x="350" y="152" width="240" height="58" rx="8" fill="#e4f5ec" stroke="#0f9d68"/>
      <text x="470" y="176" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#0a7a50" text-anchor="middle">同一套卷、只看不一致对</text>
      <text x="470" y="197" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#0a7a50" text-anchor="middle">200 题级即可见信号（如 15:5）</text>

      <text x="320" y="246" font-size="9.5" fill="#475569" text-anchor="middle">所以所有模型必须考同一套卷；「51 比 49」在 100 道不同题上，是统计平局</text>
      <text x="320" y="262" font-size="8.5" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle">示意（Wald 近似口径；小样本用 Wilson 区间），数值见正文</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
</figure>
